---
id: KelolaMappingDokumenPosisi
title: Kelola Mapping Dokumen Posisi (Parent)
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as DocumentPositionMappingController
    participant DPM as DocumentPositionMapping Model
    participant DB as Database

    HR->>UI: Buka menu Data Master > Mapping Dokumen Posisi
    UI->>C: GET /admin/document-position-mappings
    note over C: Mapping: Posisi -> Jenis Dokumen Required
    C->>DPM: Fetch semua mapping dengan relasi posisi dan jenis dokumen
    DPM->>DB: SELECT dpm.*, p.name as position_name, dt.name as document_name FROM document_position_mappings dpm JOIN positions p JOIN document_types dt ORDER BY p.name, dt.name
    DB-->>DPM: List mapping
    DPM-->>C: Collection mappings
    C-->>UI: Response dengan daftar mapping
    UI-->>HR: Tampilkan tabel: Posisi | Jenis Dokumen | Wajib? dengan opsi Add, Edit, Delete

